      "text": "These are my own synthesis notes, not official material. Based on **Template Abilities | Creating in Fortnite** — Epic Games livestream, published 2 September 2026 by **Fortnite Developers**. Watch the original: [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xSdtmO_XLy0](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xSdtmO_XLy0)"
